Deck focus (Super+g focusmaster): in the deck layout Super+j/k cycle within the
master area or the stack (wrapping) instead of the whole client list; Super+g
focuses the first master, and from the master area returns to the stack card used
last. The layout symbol shows the shown card as [D pos/count]. Applies after deck.patch.

